{"full":"hf:rohanjain1648/alice-rl-environment","spaceId":"rohanjain1648/alice-rl-environment","name":"ALICE RL Environment","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","rl-environment","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":4,"created":"2026-04-25T19:04:05.000Z","updated":"2026-04-26T11:16:40.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://rohanjain1648-alice-rl-environment.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/rohanjain1648/alice-rl-environment","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:35.691Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:35.691Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:35.691Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🔬","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["ALICE is a closed-loop, adversarial RL training environment for LLMs. It implements a continuous hunt → verify → repair → escalate cycle: the environment generates tasks that sit just at the frontier of the model's capability, grades responses through a three-tier verifier, banks novel failures, and escalates difficulty as the model improves — all without any human labels or static datasets.","Built on top of OpenEnv and deployed as a Hugging Face Docker Space.","Static benchmarks saturate. Once a model solves most of a fixed test set, scores cluster near the ceiling and stop measuring real capability differences."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/rohanjain1648/alice-rl-environment/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cff0f2a07e21a728a4b4cc73b880f5aa336d1b4ca1a361b7e86a317b11586fb7","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:41.061Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:35.718Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"ALICE is a closed-loop, adversarial RL training environment for LLMs. It implements a continuous hunt → verify → repair → escalate cycle: the environment generates tasks that sit just at